\f0\fs24 \cf0 This release of OpenAFS is targeted at MacOS 27.X (Golden Gate) and is not recommended for use with any other version.

\par\par\pard {\b Important note:} If you do not see an 'afscell' section to
 the left (between 'License' and 'Destination Select'), an Apple installer bug
 is preventing our installer plugin from running, and OpenAFS will be installed
 with the default cell 'grand.central.org'.

\par\par\pard To configure your local cell and/or cell aliases, edit
 /var/db/openafs/etc/ThisCell and/or CellAlias after installation.}
